{"chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1","number":28,"title":"Perfekt Einführung","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Hallo Vera Was hast du gestern gemacht","speaker":"Jens","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich habe lange gearbeitet Und du","speaker":"Vera","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Oh Ich bin nach Hamburg gefahren","speaker":"Jens","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Wirklich Was hast du dort gemacht","speaker":"Vera","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ich habe meinen Bruder besucht Wir haben zusammen gespielt","speaker":"Jens","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Das klingt gut Ich habe nur Kaffee getrunken","speaker":"Vera","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":7,"text":"Hast du am Abend auch gearbeitet","speaker":"Jens","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":8,"text":"Nein am Abend habe ich nur geschlafen","speaker":"Vera","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":9,"text":"Ach so Dann hast du heute sicher mehr Zeit","speaker":"Jens","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-28-perfekt","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx